OL,3,GNEWSASon charged with murdering parents
OL,4,Aappears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith murdering his parents in their own
OL,8,Fhome.
OL,10,FIsmail Ahmed Yeli, 80, and 78-year-old
OL,11,FFatma Leli were found stabbed to death
OL,12,Fin a house on Hardman Street in
OL,13,FBlackburn on Monday, Lancashire Police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FTheir family described the couple as
OL,17,F"inseparable", adding they were
OL,18,F"heartbroken" to have lost "the oldest
OL,19,Fand most cherished members of our
OL,20,Ffamily".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
