OL,3,GNEWSASon charged with murdering parents
OL,4,Aappears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FYasin Leli, 46, also of Hardman Street,
OL,7,Fhas been charged with two counts of
OL,8,Fmurder and appeared at Blackburn
OL,9,FMagistrates Court where he was told he
OL,10,Fwould next appear at Preston Crown
OL,11,FCourt on 15 September.
